    <elementParameter field="TABLE" name="VALUES">
      <elementValue elementRef="SCHEMA_COLUMN" value="body" id="0"/>
      <elementValue elementRef="VALUE" value="&quot;&lt;html>&lt;head>&lt;meta charset=\&quot;UTF-8\&quot;>&lt;style>body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f5f6f8;margin:0;padding:20px;}.card{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);padding:28px;max-width:360px;margin:auto;}h2{color:#1a1a2e;font-size:20px;margin:0 0 8px;}p{color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 20px;}label{display:block;font-weight:bold;color:#333;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:6px;}input{width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;}button{width:100%;background:#c0392b;color:#fff;border:none;padding:14px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer;}button:hover{background:#a93226;}button:disabled{background:#999;cursor:not-allowed;}#estado{margin-top:16px;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;display:none;}#estado.ok{background:#d4edda;color:#155724;display:block;}#estado.err{background:#f8d7da;color:#721c24;display:block;}#estado.load{background:#fff3cd;color:#856404;display:block;}&lt;/style>&lt;/head>&lt;body>&lt;div class=\&quot;card\&quot;>&lt;h2>Solicitud de eliminaci\u00f3n&lt;/h2>&lt;p>Ingrese el RUT del cliente. La solicitud ser\u00e1 enviada al orquestador y se consultar\u00e1 autom\u00e1ticamente el estado de ejecuci\u00f3n.&lt;/p>&lt;label>RUT del cliente&lt;/label>&lt;input id=\&quot;rut\&quot; placeholder=\&quot;10000004-4\&quot;/>&lt;button id=\&quot;btn\&quot; onclick=\&quot;eliminar()\&quot;>Eliminar datos&lt;/button>&lt;div id=\&quot;estado\&quot;>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;script>function eliminar(){var b=document.getElementById('btn'),e=document.getElementById('estado');b.disabled=true;b.innerText='Procesando...';e.className='load';e.innerText='Enviando solicitud y consultando estado...';fetch('/deletion/delete',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({rut:document.getElementById('rut').value})}).then(function(r){return r.json();}).then(function(d){if(d.estado==='ELIMINADO'){e.className='ok';e.innerText='\u2714 Estado: ELIMINADO';}else{e.className='err';e.innerText='Estado: '+d.estado;}b.disabled=false;b.innerText='Eliminar datos';}).catch(function(err){e.className='err';e.innerText='Error de conexi\u00f3n';b.disabled=false;b.innerText='Eliminar datos';});}&lt;/script>&lt;/body>&lt;/html>&quot;" id="1"/>
